}]],[[{"text":"credit card"}],[{"text":"買い物の代金を借り、後で返済する形のカードです。"}]],[[{"text":"receipt"}],[{"text":"買い物や支払いの記録です。"}]],[[{"text":"sale"}],[{"text":"価格を下げて売る期間や、そのような販売の提示です。"}]],[[{"text":"refund"}],[{"text":"購入後に返されるお金、または返金です。"}]],[[{"text":"exchange"}],[{"text":"商品を別の商品に替えることです。"}]],[[{"text":"ATM"}],[{"text":"特定の銀行取引を行う機械です。"}]],[[{"text":"contactless payment"}],[{"text":"対応するカードや端末を読み取り機に近づけて行う支払いです。"}]]],"span":[40,50],"phraseIds":["ch34-p62356943295304","ch34-p255973455608270","ch34-p17104472945419","ch34-p94581807179914","ch34-p118208389278681","ch34-p243402264651903","ch34-p184338334106938","ch34-p151146977130135","ch34-p198472775940055"],"phraseCells":[["ch34-p62356943295304",null],["ch34-p255973455608270",null],["ch34-p17104472945419",null],["ch34-p94581807179914",null],["ch34-p118208389278681",null],["ch34-p243402264651903",null],["ch34-p184338334106938",null],["ch34-p151146977130135",null],["ch34-p198472775940055",null]]},{"id":"ja-34-study-2-1","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"refund","emphasis":true},{"text":" はお金が返ること、"},{"text":"exchange","emphasis":true},{"text":" は商品を替えることです。どちらも「返品に関係する言葉」ですが、求める結果が違います。"}],"span":[52,52],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-34-study-2-2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"単語は、よく使うまとまりでも練習しましょう。"},{"text":"pay for a jacket","emphasis":true},{"text":" はジャケットの代金を払うこと、"},{"text":"get a receipt","emphasis":true},{"text":" は購入や支払いの記録を受け取ること、"},{"text":"return an item","emphasis":true},{"text":" は商品を返品すること、"},{"text":"ask for a refund","emphasis":true},{"text":" は返金を求めることです。返金を尋ねたからといって、その店が必ず応じると決まるわけではありません。"}],"span":[54,54],"phraseIds":["ch34-p263521475655958","ch34-p159264354511890","ch34-p9167448081781","ch34-p71857855539507"]},{"id":"ch34-b6","type":"conversation","turns":[{"speaker":"A","runs":[{"text":"I'm looking for a bookstore."}],"id":"ch34-line43","person":"A","en":"I'm looking for a bookstore.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8035823.svg"},{"speaker":"B","runs":[{"text":"There's one near the library."}],"id":"ch34-line44","person":"B","en":"There's one near the library.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8035824.svg"},{"speaker":"A","runs":[{"text":"Thanks. And is there an ATM nearby?"}],"id":"ch34-line45","person":"A","en":"Thanks. And is there an ATM nearby?","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8035823.svg"},{"speaker":"B","runs":[{"text":"I don't know, but you could ask at the bank."}],"id":"ch34-line46","person":"B","en":"I don't know, but you could ask at the bank.","ja":"","portrait":"portrait-8035824.svg"}],"span":[43,46],"art":"ch34-scene-0.svg","theme":"shops","people":["A","B"],"caption":"お金と買い物","phraseIds":["ch34-line43","ch34-line44","ch34-line45","ch34-line46"]},{"id":"ja-34-study-2-4","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Aは本屋を探していると伝えています。Bは図書館の近くにあると答えます。続いてAは近くにATMがあるかを聞きます。Bは場所を知らないので、銀行で尋ねるという方法を提案しています。"},{"text":"I'm looking for...","emphasis":true},{"text":" の後に探している場所を置くと、用件がはっきりします。"}],"span":[61,61],"phraseIds":[]}],"line":38},{"id":"34-words","title":"言葉と表現","blocks":[{"id":"34-glossary","type":"vocabulary","phraseIds":["ch34-v0","ch34-v1","ch34-v2","ch34-v3"]}]}],"practice":[{"id":"34-practice-0","title":"自分で試す","blocks":[{"id":"ch34-b7","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"number":1,"runs":[{"text":"次の用件に合う場所を選び、"},{"text":"I'm looking for...","emphasis":true},{"text":" を使って答えてください。用件は、"},{"text":"a loaf of bread","emphasis":true},{"text":"（パン一つ）、"},{"text":"a hammer","emphasis":true},{"text":"（金づち）、"},{"text":"a haircut","emphasis":true},{"text":"（散髪）、"},{"text":"information about mailing a box","emphasis":true},{"text":"（箱を郵送するための情報）です。"}],"id":"ch34-b7-0"},{"number":2,"runs":[{"text":"次の意味に合う言葉を選んでください。購入の記録、お金が返されること、順番を待つ人々、棚の間の通路です。"}],"id":"ch34-b7-1"},{"number":3,"runs":[{"text":"次の架空の案内一覧を使います："},{"text":"Pine Bakery, Lake Hardware, Oak Pharmacy, West Post Office","emphasis":true},{"text":"。"},{"text":"nails","emphasis":true},{"text":"（くぎ）、"},{"text":"bread","emphasis":true},{"text":"（パン）、"},{"text":"mailing help","emphasis":true},{"text":"（郵送についての手助け）を求めるなら、どこへ行けばよいか尋ねてください。一人なら、尋ねる役と答える役の両方を行います。"}],"id":"ch34-b7-2"}],"span":[65,67],"phraseIds":[]}],"line":65,"answers":[{"id":"ja-34-practice-0-1","type":"answer","runs":[{"text":"答えの例:","emphasis":true},{"text":" “I'm looking for a bakery / hardware store / hair salon / post office.” 語彙問題の答えは "},{"text":"receipt, refund, line, aisle","emphasis":true},{"text":" です。“Where can I buy nails?” — “Try Lake Hardware.”"}],"span":[69,69],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-34-practice-0-2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"最初の例は、必要なものやサービスに合う店を選んでいます。最後の会話は、くぎを買える場所を聞き、架空の一覧にある店を勧めるやり取りです。"}],"span":[71,71],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ja-34-practice-0-3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"後で一覧を隠し、役立つ言葉を三つ使って一つの用件を説明してください。相手が、行きたい場所や必要なものを判断できるかを確認しましょう。すべての項目を覚えている必要はありません。"}],"span":[73,73],"phraseIds":[]}]}],"phrases":[{"id":"ch34-p63082605","en":"grocery store","section":"34-study-0","context":"食料品店","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p152554743837932","art":"word-cart.svg"},{"id":"ch34-p676712488","en":"supermarket","section":"34-study-0","context":"食料品や日常の生活用品を売る店です。","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p152554743837932"},{"id":"ch34-p151591876657435","en":"convenience store","section":"34-study-0","context":"比較的小さく、さまざまな日用品を扱う店です。","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p151591876657435"},{"id":"ch34-p228331087654292","en":"hardware store","section":"34-study-0","context":"工具や、家で行う作業の材料・用品を売る店です。","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p228331087654292"},{"id":"ch34-p206647790336621","en":"garden center","section":"34-study-0","context":"植物や園芸用品を売る場所です。","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p206647790336621"},{"id":"ch34-p133502944008272","en":"gas station","section":"34-study-0","context":"車などに燃料を入れられる場所です。","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p133502944008272"},{"id":"ch34-p115825383582297","en":"shopping mall","section":"34-study-0","context":"一つの商業施設に複数の店が集まっている場所です。","kind":"word","ja":"","studyId":"ch34-p115825383582297"},{"id":"ch34-p86252867359636",